The code in this folder is adapted from:

  Sachit Menon and Carl Vondrick, "Visual Classification via Description from
  Large Language Models", ICLR 2023. https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.07183
  Code: https://github.com/sachit-menon/classify_by_description_release

The upstream repository does not include a LICENSE file. The upstream code is
used here for research reproducibility only; please cite the paper above when
using this part of the code:

  @article{menon2022visual,
    author  = {Menon, Sachit and Vondrick, Carl},
    title   = {Visual Classification via Description from Large Language Models},
    journal = {ICLR},
    year    = {2023},
  }

Derived files: loading_helpers.py (from loading_helpers.py and
descriptor_strings.py), generate_descriptors.py (prompt format and parsing),
load_coco.py / main_coco.py (COCO adaptation of load.py / main.py).
Changes: COCO object-crop dataset, per-instance concept-vector labelling,
Rule 1/2/3 statistics, binarization (binarize_concepts.py, new).
